        {
          "type": "line",
          "line": {
            "speaker": "npc",
            "name": "Quire",
            "text": "Read, dust, file, copy. All of it ours\nagain. And a name at the bottom."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "line": {
            "speaker": "npc",
            "name": "Notary",
            "text": "The Minotaur. I wrote 'nothing guards them'\nbecause I was afraid to write the name."
